<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Mercantil denies sale to Santander.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Mercantil denies sale to Santander.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Venezuelan bank Banco Mercantil denied reports it was negotiating the sale of a large stake to Spanish bank Banco Santander.</p>
<p>Bank President Gustavo Maturet shot down local press reports that key Mercantil shareholders planned to sell to the Spanish bank.</p>
<p>&quot;Nor has Banco Santander approached them to acquire the shares,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
